{{zone|The Forge}} is an area of {{zone|Dwarven Mines}}. Players can use it to refine certain items into their refined form, and create powerful gear, items, [[Accessories]] and even [[Pets]]. {{HotM|2}} is required to use it. Players have a limited amount of processes available to them at a single time, with additional slots and new recipes unlocking with {{HotM}} progression.

{{ZoneText|Refine ores and cast items at the &6Forge&f!}}

Despite the area having no requirements, {{Skill|Mining|15}} is required to Fast Travel there, except on {{Gamemode|Bingo}}.
== Mechanics ==
* Forging processes cannot be canceled once started.
* Players begin with {{green|2}} Forge slots at {{HotM|2}}. From there, each {{HotM}} tier grants another forge slot, up to {{Purple|'''Tier 7'''}}.
* Forge Time may be decreased by the following sources, stacking {{aqua|'''additively'''}}. 

