== Trivia ==
* Upgrading an item in the forge, such as Drill or Lantern, keeps all modifications on the item, such as [[Reforge]] or [[Enchantments]].
* In the {{Zone|Crystal Hollows}}, there is a structure that serves as a miniature version of '''The Forge'''.
* Forge can be accessed remotely by contacting {{NPCSprite|Fred}} via {{Item|Abiphone Basic|text=Abiphone}}.

